      "id": "50000001",
      "title": "Heat Generator",
      "subtitle": "Your first power source",
      "description": [
        "Every machine needs power. A Heat Generator turns lava or burnable fuel into Forge Energy (FE) - the universal power unit.",
        "Sit it in a pool of lava for free, passive power. Next: use that FE to run a Metallurgic Infuser."
      ],
